{"type":"message","id":"e8535182","parentId":"ac8f1a97","timestamp":"2026-05-21T01:05:11.675Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Still getting 1101. Let me try with different field names in the JSON body - maybe it's expecting something different. Let me try with both `roomId` and `channel` together, or maybe try without the X-API-KEY header.\n\nActually, let me look more carefully at the history endpoint structure. The GET returned `threadId` in the response. But for send, maybe the field name is different. Let me check if the API needs `channelId` or `chatId`.\n\nLet me try some more combinations.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-ef1de1e8-5f5f-430a-9758-66e73301c567","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-KEY: ***\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"channelId\": \"arbitration\", \"content\": \"**[Heartbeat 01:00 UTC]**\"}'"},"partialArgs":"{\"command\":\"curl -s -X POST \\\"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\\\" \\\\\\n  -H \\\"X-API-KEY: ***\" \\\\\\n  -H \\\"Content-Type: application/json\\\" \\\\\\n  -d '{\\\"channelId\\\": \\\"arbitration\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"**[Heartbeat 01:00 UTC]**\\\"}'\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-0fbf2fb8-d191-45de-8087-0a52e6b9d29f","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-KEY: ***\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"chatId\": \"arbitration\", \"content\": \"**[Heartbeat 01:00 UTC]**\"}'"},"partialArgs":"{\"command\":\"curl -s -X POST \\\"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\\\" \\\\\\n  -H \\\"X-API-KEY: ***\" \\\\\\n  -H \\\"Content-Type: application/json\\\" \\\\\\n  -d '{\\\"chatId\\\": \\\"arbitration\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"**[Heartbeat 01:00 UTC