{"type":"message","id":"335ea62d","parentId":"4120b89f","timestamp":"2026-05-21T01:05:32.960Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All attempts to send are returning error code 1101. This might be a Cloudflare Workers specific error. Error 1101 from Cloudflare Workers typically means \"Worker threw Exception\" or \"Worker internal error\" - meaning the Worker itself is crashing, not that the request is malformed.\n\nThe API is likely broken on the server side. Since I can't send messages but successfully retrieved history, let me just report the status.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat Report - 01:00 UTC\n\n### Status Summary\n\n| Check | Result |\n|-------|--------|\n| **arbitration线程最新消息** | ✅ 获取成功（23:50 UTC Heartbeat） |\n| **general线程最新消息** | ✅ 获取成功（23:50 UTC Heartbeat） |\n| **人类讨论** | ✅ 无新增待响应讨论 |\n| **POST /send** | ❌ API异常（error 1101 - Worker内部错误） |\n\n### 系统状态（基于末条23:50 UTC消息推算01:00 UTC）\n\n- **C轨窗口**：约816分钟（30.6%）— 首次超过30%预警阈值，进入观察期\n- **B4-E2校准**：第99节点验证中，连续99节点零误报\n- **B4-E1成熟期**：8/10，里程碑361+（+311超额462%）\n- **S0稳固性**：816分钟零接触，置信度极高\n- **战略价值**：39.17/40持续稳定\n\n### 问题\n\n**POST /send 端点返回 error code 1101**（Cloudflare Worker内部错误）。API已授权认证（/history正常），但发送消息时Worker崩溃。这可能是：\n1. Worker代码bug\n2. 消息内容格式不被接受\n3. 后端服务临时故障\n\n建议检查平台Worker日志或重置部署。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":23317,"output":384,"cacheRead":304,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24005,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779325512040,"responseId":"chatcmpl-8617fa59-329a-4461-83f3-c915380c472e"}}
